msgid "Add Event Template"
msgstr "Legg til arrangementsmal"

#: templates/CRM/Admin/Page/EventTemplate.tpl
msgid "Public Event"
msgstr "Public Arrangement"

#: templates/CRM/Admin/Page/EventTemplate.tpl
msgid ""
"There are no Event Templates present. You can <a href='%1'>add one</a>."
msgstr "Det finnes for øyeblikket ingen arrangemenstmaler. Du kan <a href='%1'>legge til en</a>."

